Data for SOD4SB
===============

The images are not redistributed. Download them from the MVA 2023 SOD4SB challenge organisers and place them as:

    mva2023_sod4bird_train/
        images/                         8,880 training + 879 validation frames, 3840x2160 .jpg
        annotations/                    official COCO files of the challenge
    drone2021/                          optional, only for pretraining
        images/
        annotations/

What is in this folder
----------------------
mva_audited_v1/manifest.json
    Checksums and the list of changes of the audited labels. The audited annotation files themselves are created
    locally with

        python scripts/prepare_fixed50.py

    which writes mva_audited_v1/annotations/split_train_coco.json and split_val_coco.json. The only change to the
    official validation labels is the removal of one exactly duplicated box (2,864 instead of 2,865 boxes).

Splits used in the paper
------------------------
    Drone2021 train   51,119 images   55,469 boxes   pretraining
    Drone2021 val     13,572 images   11,197 boxes   checkpoint of the pretraining run
    MVA train          8,880 images   26,172 boxes   fine-tuning
    MVA val (audited)    879 images    2,864 boxes   all results in the paper
    MVA public test    9,699 images    no labels     one submission file only

load_data.py reads these files (load_annotations, list_images, load_image).
